{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "urn:exactcis:boschloo:global-checker:v1",
  "title": "Frozen data-only candidate schema; no checker implementation or soundness theorem yet",
  "description": "Structural JSON shape only. All semantic obligations in GLOBAL_CHECKER_V1.md must be checked before Success. No producer-supplied proof fields, complete-partition flags, mask-correctness flags, counters, hull-validity flags or topology claims. UNRESOLVED is not a successful leaf state.",
